1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,800
Past the kitchen, a pair of golden
doors. The grand ballroom.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:09,733
A piano. A chandelier. Chairs stacked
to the ceiling. And the whole room is
tilting, slowly.

3
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:13,567
Then the ship rolls in the swell. And
the piano begins to slide.

4
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:20,800
Rule six. Stay away from anything
heavy that isn't tied down. A ship
keeps moving, even when it's dead.

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,200
The piano slams into the wall, right
where Sam was standing a second ago.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,667
I'd like a refund.
